courtesy of Kim Jong Un in 2015...

00:06:15.510 --> 00:06:23.590
[An all-female North Korean pop band formed
by leader Kim Jong Un abruptly canceled a

00:06:23.590 --> 00:06:28.990
Beijing concert on Saturday and headed back
home to Pyongyang, ]

00:06:28.990 --> 00:06:38.220
But, undoubtedly, February 2017 became the breaking point for this friendship.

00:06:38.220 --> 00:06:42.690
North Korea launching some ballistic missiles or conducting some nuclear tests is nothing new.

00:06:42.690 --> 00:06:47.750
But what is new is the degree to which
China is willing to criticize it.

00:06:47.750 --> 00:06:52.380
This is happening at a time when Chinese leader Xi Jinping is trying to improve his relationship

00:06:52.380 --> 00:07:02.380
with United States. And, of course, according to Pyongyang, this is a stab in the back.

00:07:02.380 --> 00:07:06.210
It triggered the war of words between these two countries, with state-run media in both

00:07:06.210 --> 00:07:08.340
countries criticizing the other.

00:07:08.340 --> 00:07:12.490
But this is not the end of the story! Remember
those Chinese trained North Korean hackers

00:07:12.490 --> 00:07:17.420
